'' The parser's interface and class diagnostics, TKO0428-TKO0438 (docs/tiko-interfaces
'' §13.2), one per line. TKO0431 and TKO0434 are not used (see diagids.ti).
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-ast tests/diagnostics/src/interface-parse-errors.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-OUT: interface-parse-errors.bas(7,5): error TKO0428: an interface holds only 'inherits' lines and member declarations; 'as' cannot appear in one
