'' EXPECT-OUT: interface-parse-errors.bas(11,5): error TKO0429: 'override'
'' EXPECT-OUT: interface-parse-errors.bas(13,5): error TKO0435: 'inherits' lines come first
'' EXPECT-OUT: interface-parse-errors.bas(16,10): error TKO0432: a class names its base
'' EXPECT-OUT: interface-parse-errors.bas(19,10): error TKO0437: a class cannot be 'extern "c"'
'' EXPECT-OUT: interface-parse-errors.bas(23,24): error TKO0436: write 'implements' on its own line in the body of 'T1'
